1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,755
A NIfTI file stores numerical samples
arranged in space.

2
00:00:04,755 --> 00:00:09,509
One sample is a voxel, a tiny
three-dimensional box.

3
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:14,792
Voxels form slices, slices form a
three-dimensional volume, and repeated

4
00:00:14,792 --> 00:00:18,490
volumes form a four-dimensional fMRI time
series.

5
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:24,926
An anatomical image is often one
three-dimensional volume.

6
00:00:24,926 --> 00:00:31,065
A BOLD image usually contains many volumes
sampled at successive time points.

7
00:00:31,065 --> 00:00:36,692
The file header records dimensions, voxel
sizes, orientation transforms, and timing

8
00:00:36,692 --> 00:00:40,273
so software can interpret the array
correctly.

9
00:00:42,567 --> 00:00:45,101
Fslinfo exposes the image header.

10
00:00:45,101 --> 00:00:51,184
Here, the first three dimensions describe
a sixty-four by sixty-four by forty

11
00:00:51,184 --> 00:00:52,198
spatial grid.

12
00:00:52,198 --> 00:00:58,788
Dimension four contains two hundred forty
time points, and pixdim four reports a

13
00:00:58,788 --> 00:01:00,308
two-second repetition time.

14
00:01:00,308 --> 00:01:03,857
These values describe sampling, not data
quality.

15
00:01:06,567 --> 00:01:11,449
Voxel dimensions define spatial sampling,
not anatomical precision.

16
00:01:11,449 --> 00:01:17,552
Smaller voxels can reduce signal-to-noise,
and functional localization also depends

17
00:01:17,552 --> 00:01:21,214
on physiology, preprocessing, and
experimental design.

18
00:01:21,214 --> 00:01:27,927
Never translate voxel size directly into
certainty about a cognitive process.

19
00:01:30,367 --> 00:01:34,648
A NIfTI image is a structured numerical
container.

20
00:01:34,648 --> 00:01:39,464
Understand its voxels, volumes,
dimensions, orientation, and timing before

21
00:01:39,464 --> 00:01:41,070
analyzing intensity values.

22
00:01:41,070 --> 00:01:48,562
Sampling describes how data were arranged;
it does not guarantee what the data can

23
00:01:48,562 --> 00:01:49,097
reveal.
